        <mxCell id="QcWilovOGVgIscdPZ2Kh-10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;1. Responsible for handling incoming and outgoing traffic to insure that everything is working as desired&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Only allowed traffic is able to reach the Pods&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Only allowed traffic is able to leave the Worker Node&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
