        <mxCell id="V26fkm4jlTxHl5S7Bxqv-46" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=default;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontStyle=1;align=left;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Scheduler&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 15, 15); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Used to assign PODs to the worker nodes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 15, 15); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 15, 15); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;1. It will check which&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 15, 15); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;nodes have enough capacity to launch the new POD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 15, 15); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 15, 15); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;2. Watching our pods and choosing worker nodes on which new pods should be created on, in case a new pod needs to be added because a pod got unhealthy and went down, or because of scaling, we needed to create a new pod.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 15, 15); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); color: rgb(15, 15, 15); font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
